[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11100100_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11100100_02_0010","text":"嗯——……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11100100_02_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11100100_02_0020","text":"这样……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11100100_02_0030","text":"嗯——，这样可以吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11100100_02_0040","text":"请、请进！\n欢迎——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11100100_02_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11100100_02_0050","text":"辛苦了，树里\n嗯，果然很合适！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11100100_02_0060","text":"之后的拍摄也很期待"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11100100_02_0070","text":"啊、嗯……\n但是，我不知道该摆什么姿势才好……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11100100_02_0080","text":"什么都不用想就好\n放松，保持平时的树里就好"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11100100_02_0090","text":"诶，这样就行了吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11100100_02_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11100100_02_0100","text":"知道了。我相信你说的话"}]
